      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Theres a lot of creative ways to get around this for well established games. Where its need shines, is VERY in development titles that may rapidly change their variables while building things out early.\n\nI would love to launch our game, and right before i do, click \"clear all player data for this world\" button on the webpage. If I can delete the world from there, deleting data should exist too.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
